@host = http://localhost:5292

### List all bookings
GET {{host}}/api/bookings

### Add an apartment booking
# @name apartment
POST {{host}}/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "apartment",
  "primaryGuestName": "Alex Morgan",
  "primaryGuestEmail": "alex@example.com",
  "startDate": "2026-12-18",
  "endDate": "2026-12-22",
  "notes": "Late arrival, around 22:00"
}

### Add a vehicle booking
POST {{host}}/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "vehicle",
  "primaryGuestName": "Alex Morgan",
  "primaryGuestEmail": "alex@example.com",
  "startDate": "2026-12-18",
  "endDate": "2026-12-22",
  "notes": "Compact, automatic"
}

### Add a show booking (single day, so start and end match)
POST {{host}}/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "show",
  "primaryGuestName": "Alex Morgan",
  "primaryGuestEmail": "alex@example.com",
  "startDate": "2027-03-04",
  "endDate": "2027-03-04",
  "notes": "Two tickets, stalls"
}

### Read the apartment booking back
GET {{host}}/api/bookings/{{apartment.response.body.id}}

### Edit it (stay extended by a day)
PUT {{host}}/api/bookings/{{apartment.response.body.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "apartment",
  "primaryGuestName": "Alex Morgan",
  "primaryGuestEmail": "alex@example.com",
  "startDate": "2026-12-18",
  "endDate": "2026-12-23",
  "notes": "Late arrival, around 22:00"
}

### Remove it
DELETE {{host}}/api/bookings/{{apartment.response.body.id}}

### Reading it again returns 404
GET {{host}}/api/bookings/{{apartment.response.body.id}}


### --- Failure cases ---

### Missing name and end before start (expect 400 with an errors object)
POST {{host}}/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "apartment",
  "primaryGuestName": "",
  "primaryGuestEmail": "not-an-email",
  "startDate": "2026-12-22",
  "endDate": "2026-12-18"
}

### Editing a booking that does not exist (expect 404)
PUT {{host}}/api/bookings/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "apartment",
  "primaryGuestName": "Alex Phelps",
  "primaryGuestEmail": "alex@example.com",
  "startDate": "2026-11-18",
  "endDate": "2026-11-22",
  "notes": null
}

### Removing a booking that does not exist (expect 404)
DELETE {{host}}/api/bookings/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### OpenAPI document (development only)
GET {{host}}/openapi/v1/openapi.json